      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/85e7bf/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-16T05:27:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Alternate Cards would be sweet. Alternate art cards would be really cool too. Have you all looked into doing alternate art cards for villains and heroes?</p>",
