    {
      "id": 21396,
      "name": "Citizen Jodie",
      "username": "Citizen_Jodie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/citizen_jodie/{size}/2316_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-17T04:55:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m with everyone here.   I love the effect alternate cards have on the game.  I do think that having cards with alternate text as well as art is important.  The trick with that, though, seems to be 1) having a reason for characters to have alternate cards 2) making it different enough that it is worthwhile.  Some heroes seem to lend themselves to having alternate character cards more easily than others do.  At least, I think that would be the case.</p>",
