    {
      "id": 21397,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-17T05:33:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We have a large bag of tricks from which we can pull cool alternate rules/art/etc cards.  Now that we know that they are strongly favored by the community, we’ll try to do that wherever possible.  The biggest trick is slipping promo cards into larger print runs so that they are not too expensive.</p>",
