    {
      "id": 21399,
      "name": "beevolant",
      "username": "beevolant",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-21T17:49:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you buy the game (or expansion) at a con, I love the idea of a promo card. However, I also really like the idea of buttons or stickers as freebies for demo-ing the game at a con since it’s publicity. Art prints are awesome, but you just put them in your room or whatever and no one else sees them. Button you wear on your person walking around the con.</p>",
