      "created_at": "2011-08-26T01:04:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’d also go with the alternate cards or the art prints, I think both are great ideas.  Cards are nice for the obvious reasons that this is a game that has the major advantage of being diverse.  I like getting new cards that add to the game.  However, I’m also a huge sucker for art and the artwork on this game is AMAZING!!!</p>",
