      "created_at": "2011-08-26T01:16:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I voted for other.   I realize that this might be stretching the boundaries of reason… but maybe just a tiny, short comic book?  (puppy dog eyes).</p>\n<p>If that’s not on the table, then my back-up vote is for art.   I really like the Next Legacy card, but I’m not sure how excited I’d be if every deck had two alternate versions,  I think it would take away from the uniqueness of the game rather than add to it.    Just  alternate legacy alone is great,  no need to muck things up, IMO.</p>",
